---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeroWithForm from '../components/HeroWithForm.astro';
import ReviewsCarousel from '../components/ReviewsCarousel.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base
  title="Reviews | Ninja Plumbers London"
  description="Customer reviews for Ninja Plumbers, London, from Google — each one tied to a real completed job."
>

<HeroWithForm
  eyebrow="Reviews"
  h1="Customer reviews"
  intro="Pulled from Google, each one tied to a job we actually did. The record is still growing — this is what's been added so far, not the whole of it."
  breadcrumb={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Reviews' }]}
  bullets={[
    'Gas Safe registered and fully insured',
    'DBS-checked engineers',
    'Emergency callout available 24/7',
    'Price agreed before work starts',
  ]}
  formHeading="Send us the job"
/>

<ReviewsCarousel />

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <h2>About these reviews</h2>
    <p>Every review here is copied across from our own Google listing, unedited beyond the reviewer's own text and star rating. Nothing is written or invented for this page &mdash; if it isn&rsquo;t a real review we can point back to, it doesn&rsquo;t go up.</p>
    <p>The record is added to by hand as new reviews come in, so what you see above is a growing selection rather than the complete history &mdash; the full picture is on our Google listing directly.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:44px;">Had a job done by us?</h2>
    <p>Feedback is useful either way. If something wasn&rsquo;t right, we&rsquo;d far rather hear it from you directly and put it straight.</p>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li><strong>Call the office</strong> &mdash; <a href={`tel:${site.booking.tel}`}>{site.booking.display}</a>, {site.hours.office}</li>
      <li><strong>WhatsApp</strong> &mdash; <a href={site.whatsapp.url}>{site.whatsapp.display}</a></li>
      <li><strong>Email</strong> &mdash; <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
      <li><strong>Speak to management</strong> &mdash; <a href={`tel:${site.management.tel}`}>{site.management.display}</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href={`tel:${site.booking.tel}`} class="btn btn-orange btn-lg">Call {site.booking.display}</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-navy btn-lg">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
